  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Land and real estate registration project in Kyrgystan for 2.5 years with Swedesurvey as Swedish part and GosRegister as Kyrgys part. Includes the development of 50 registration offices all througout the country, support to the legalislation of landownership ,database and study visit to Sweden and/or relevant eastern country.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">L&#xE4;ntm&#xE4;teri projekt i Kyrgystan under 2.5 &#xE5;r med Swedsurvey som svensk part och GosRegister som Kyrgysisk part. Bla ing&#xE5;r utveckling av 50 registreringskontor runtom i landet, st&#xF6;d till utveckling av lagar, IT samt studiebes&#xF6;k i Sverige eller &#xF6;st land.</narrative>
  </description>
